message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
title: "Arguo"
type: software
authors:
  - alias: "Zynu"
    website: "https://github.com/izynu"
  - alias: "Shraddha"
    website: "https://github.com/xhraddha"
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-10-24"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/izynu/arguo"
abstract: >-
  Arguo is an open-source research intelligence toolkit with three
  deliverables: an agent skill that encodes an evidence-first research method,
  a Python research agent with a traceable evidence ledger, citation auditing,
  and an explicit insufficient-evidence verdict, and a curated catalog of 1,570
  research resources across 50 categories plus a static documentation site.
keywords:
  - research
  - evidence
  - citations
  - fact-checking
  - open-source
